# Node-local secret values, one NAME=value per line. A project's secret grant names the NAME.
# Values run verbatim to the end of the line, so do not quote them. Keep this file root:nexus, mode 0640.
# STRIPE_KEY=sk_test_...
# GH_TOKEN lets agents create GitHub repositories with gh and push to them, for projects granted
# GH_TOKEN:api.github.com,github.com. A fine-grained token needs Administration and Contents read and write.
# GH_TOKEN=github_pat_...
